334 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The goal of our eventual product, developed in line with the collaborative commitments formulated with DRO-DMI, is to create a digital tool that enables more effective public dialogue and fosters open collaboration, particularly between experts and non-experts in the field of transport. Through this tool, we aim to strengthen shared understanding and support constructive engagement between \(municipal\) stakeholders and involved residents.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
