338 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This report follows our step-by-step process during the Living Lab project. The description of the process contains background theory for context and better understanding of current decision-making processes in the study area. Subsequently, the living lab approach and methods used in this project are explained. After the process, the results are presented in order of the research questions. The insights from our literature review, interviews and co creation are incorporated in this chapter. Afterwards, the findings are synthesized. In the final chapter we elaborate on our research outcomes and final digital tool, where its specifications and limitations are also discussed.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
