/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (At least two team members attended each interview: one as the primary interviewer and one as an observer and note-taker. With informed consent, all interviews were recorded using the Microsoft Teams transcription tool. The transcripts were analysed using an inductive thematic coding approach \(Fereday & Muir-Cochrane, 2006\). For this, two researchers independently coded the interviews, highlighting quotes and emerging categories. These were subsequently discussed, merged, and organised into thematic clusters that formed the basis for our analytical findings. This approach was adopted to ensure proper research validity and reliability in this part of the project.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
