426 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The expert interviews served both exploratory and confirmatory functions within the overall Living Lab structure. Early interviews helped frame the core challenges in road design, behavioural compliance, and institutional alignment. Meanwhile, later interviews were used to validate or nuance patterns emerging from contextual analysis, stakeholder mapping, and municipal documentation. The cumulative insights informed the iterative refinement of our research focus and the development of criteria for redefining the identity of GOW30 roads.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
