<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (13)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
435 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Panel discussion The second part of the session was centred on gaining insights into the institutional mechanisms behind the decision-making processes for GOW30 roads, as well as understanding behavioural change and cultural norms around speed-limit compliance. A panel discussion format was chosen as it enables semi-structured, interactive input from all participants, while also creating space for new perspectives, experiences and interpretations to emerge.)
/E (Panel discussion The second part of the session was centred on gaining insights into the institutional mechanisms behind the decision-making processes for GOW30 roads, as well as understanding behavioural change and cultural norms around speed-limit compliance. A panel discussion format was chosen as it enables semi-structured, interactive input from all participants, while also creating space for new perspectives, experiences and interpretations to emerge.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [0]
>>
