/S /P
/E (In the analysis of recommended GOW30 designs, the width of the central carriageway, which is also commonly referred to as middenrijloper in Dutch, emerged as a common recurrent variable across the designs \(Goudappel, 2025; Municipality of Amsterdam, 2024\). The middenrijloper is defined as the section of the road situated in-between the bicycle facilities, such as fietspaden or fietsstroken.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
