/E (This presents a trade-off in the design framework. On one hand, the central carriageway can be kept wider to accommodate traffic flow and heavy or large vehicles such as buses and emergency services. On the other hand, narrowing this section which helps stimulate lower speeds and simultaneously frees up space for e.g. wider bicycle facilities, or pavement space for pedestrians. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
