/E (In addition to the design variables, which represent the elements of a road that can be configured, the policy review also revealed a set of contextual criteria that influence the applicability of specific GOW30 design choices. These criteria emerged consistently across multiple policy documents \(CROW, 2023; Goudappel, 2025; Municipality of Amsterdam, 2024\). They act as parameters used to weigh trade-offs and which specific choice within a design variable is more suitable for a given road segment. )
