/E (The primary goal of the tool is to increase transparency within the decision-making process of GOW30 road redesigns. Because of the inherent dual function of GOW30 roads, the ideal balance of priorities varies per specific road case, which makes it hard to apply a uniform standardised design approach. )
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [13 14]
