647 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A first limitation can be found in the range of stakeholders involved. Although co-creation formed the main part of our research focus, several relevant parties remained absent during these activities. For example, emergency services, public transport operators and resident advocacy groups who also play a direct role in how GOW30 designs performs in practice. Their absence means the tool reflects only a partial view of the decision-making process. In particular, trade-offs between accessibility, response, times, road usability and liveability could not be fully explored. Including these groups in future iterations is essential to ensure that the tool can support cross-sector alignment rather than reinforcing existing silos. )
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [12 13]
>>
endobj
