/E (We would like to thank AMS Institute, the DRO-DMI consortium, SWOV, CROW, Fietsersbond, Goudappel, DTV Consultants, and all other experts who contributed their time, expertise, and perspectives throughout the project. Their insights have been invaluable in shaping this study. It is our hope that the resulting academically informed tool and findings will support practitioners, researchers, and policymakers in impactfully strengthening the future design and implementation of GOW30 roads. )
